{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["אל תפן — from the root פנה. Like ״ותרב משאת בנימין״, from רבה. אל תֵּפֶן — אל תִּפְנֶה. אל תֶּפֶן — אל תַּפְנֶה." "לא חמור אחד מהם נשאתי — I have not taken even a single donkey from them, unlike others who lord it over the people. If so, why do they put me in charge of authority?! And if it had been pointed לא חמור אַחַד מהם (with a patach), its meaning would be: a donkey belonging to one of them — like ״אַחַד העם״, and like ״את אַחַד מהם״."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:50:24.152365753Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}